note: batch 10n, part C (order derives): a field order change under a derive of a proc macro crate (`depot::Rows`, it writes the field names in order); the old name list missed each derive of a third crate
rule+: R65.3-3
must_match: spotlight: an order change in a type with `#\[repr\]`, a derive, or an attribute macro
